    "message": "Streamlined report generation and compilation.\n\n- Make sure to add trailing lines for non-terminating writeRmd calls, otherwise\n  some aspects of markdown formatting might not work.\n- Directly suppress all output when compiling the report.\n- Some rewording and typo fixes for the normalization section.\n- More symmetric handling of the lfc.threshold=NULL case for runVoom.\n",
